        "Description": "Good evening 47.\rYour next targets are members of terrorist group named TMD.\rThey will try to bring explosives to racing event and blow everything up . Client asked to take down your targets brutally to punish them for trying to kill so many people. After taking care of your targets escape by helicopter on the roof. And remember you have to be fast enough and do your task before they blow up everything.\r\rGood luck 47.",
